ink  did or didn't survive so that's the  first thing i'm going to try and justify  my calls but it is going to be to a  certain degree subjective the more  important thing that i need you all to  realize is  i'm not counting literally everything  that was killed here's what i mean by  that i'm making the call to restrict  counting only kills against what appear  to be sapient or sentient beings and  what i'm not counting  are hordes or hive minds individual  parts of a hive mind at any rate so what  that means is things like the ultron  bots which don't really think for  themselves  would not count that would include the  four armed weird monster things that  bulk out thanos's army and that would  also  include the chatari which i know some  people are going to give me pushback on  that but i'll get into this into the  actual inaugural video proper but i have  evidence to support my claim that the  chitauri are in fact a hive mind and not  a collection of sentient  individuals but i'll get into that in  the video proper now there's a couple of  reasons why i'm doing this the first is  it  keeps my job from being impossible  because there are so many times that  these you know massive amounts of things  you know whether it be the ultron bots  whether it be the undead things raised  by hella like these things are so  numerous that actually trying to count  all of them becomes a impractical and b  saps the fun out of the project for me  that's the first reason there's also the  fact that part of what i'm hoping to  find out is which of these heroes is in  fact the deadliest who has the highest  body count and if i were counting each  individual member of a hive mind or a  mindless horde  well then it's tony it would have to be  he's the one who took out the entire  chitauri invasion by blowing up their  mothership he's the one who snapped  thanos and his entire army it would be  not even close  if somebody else has the patience to go  through and try and count every single  individual thing that he takes out  through those kinds of means have at it  i won't stop you  but i'm not gonna do it now that also  means that i'm gonna have to make a call  on creatures that don't appear  necessarily to be part of a horde but  don't necessarily appear to be fully  sentient there are certain kind of  monstery beast that you know thor runs  into whatnot and i'll make a call when i  get to them now the plan right now is to  do one of these a month for the next six  months  now there is the possibility if this  ends up being a little bit more work  than i think it's going to be which  that does happen to me sometimes i might  put a gap somewhere in there or maybe it  becomes every two months if i really  need it to be but i am committing  initially to these six  and we're going to start out  on saturday  this week  with iron man  so that is the premise  the parameters and the preamble  that just leaves me with one thing left  to do  welcome to the mcu body count  [Music]  now my thanks to my highest supporting  patrons robin moore zuma  the thing that goes doink in the anime  oliver b melinda walters andelke the  oath of boy bernabby lacks the poodle  zach idolin tracy skravitt angry casper  bookworm adam rdl taylor shane ross  gourlay brendon the rose and tt if you  want to hear me possibly butcher your  name check out the rewards on the  patreon  and thanks to all you friends  [Music]  [Music]  now  [Music]
 

